# Nothing in this file is required. The demos, tests and web page run with NO environment variables.
# There are no API keys anywhere in this project: the NEAR Intents 1Click dry-run quotes need none.
#
# Only for committing to NEAR TESTNET with your own THROWAWAY testnet account (never mainnet, never a real account):
# a JSON file {"account_id": "...", "private_key": "ed25519:..."} that lives OUTSIDE this repository.
# The CLI refuses to read a key file from inside the repo.
# NEAR_KEY_FILE=/home/you/.payslip-proof/testnet/your-throwaway.testnet.json
#
# Where scripts/testnet-setup.mjs writes the keys of the throwaway accounts it creates (must be outside the repo)
# PSP_KEY_DIR=/home/you/.payslip-proof/testnet
#
# Web server port for `npm run web`
# PORT=5173
#
# Path to a Chromium/Chrome binary for the optional `npm run test:browser`
# CHROME=/usr/bin/chromium
